OL,3,GNEWSARare and expensive cards wow at
OL,4,Ahuge arena show
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 16,000 people attended one of
OL,7,Fthe UK's largest trading card events in
OL,8,FCoventry on Saturday.
OL,10,FCardmania XL brought together more than
OL,11,F300 vendors from across the country at
OL,12,FCoventry Building Society Arena, where
OL,13,Fvisitors browsed everything from
OL,14,Fpocket-money Pokemon cards to rare
OL,15,Fcollectibles worth thousands of pounds,
OL,16,Fincluding a Pikachu Rumble card on sale
OL,17,Ffor #16,000.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
