OL,3,GNEWSARare and expensive cards wow at
OL,4,Ahuge arena show
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe event gave people the chance to
OL,7,Fbuy, sell and trade cards, meet
OL,8,Fspecialist dealers and have collections
OL,9,Fgraded, with many families attending a
OL,10,Ftrading card show for the first time.
OL,12,FEight-year-old Teddy, from Coventry,
OL,13,Fsaid he was "really excited" to attend
OL,14,Fhis first event and had "enjoyed buying
OL,15,Floads of cards".
